ctor boost suggests they could exceed expectations if they can navigate the opposing pitcher's delivery pace. We are effectively capped today, so keep a close watch on **Jeremiah Jackson** and **Masyn Winn**, as their respective scores represent the lower threshold of our starting expectations.",
